    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "body": "### Problem\n\nThere's no way to open a buffer in a split, or any custom way.\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nProvide a default mapping or recipe to do this.\n\nI find a recipe more appealing as it avoids the slippery slope: there are many, many ways to open a buffer - which ones are \"deserving\" of a keybinding?\n\nAny commentary on this with your work on vim-dirvish, @justinmk?",
